WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Operate a control. Accessibility lets a tool read or use the controls an app exposes.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Capture the screen. Screen & System Audio Recording covers capture access. It is separate from control access.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Send app commands. Automation covers Apple Events that let one app command another.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Start with the task. One workflow may need more than one permission. Check the requesting app; names vary by macOS version.
